fh2-recompiled-arm64 builds FH2 Recompiled (https://github.com/gabrick75/fh2-recompiled,
GPL-3.0) and its copy of the ReXGlue SDK (BSD-3-Clause) for linux-arm64. The patches in
this repository modify those projects and are released under the same licenses.

